# --- Derived data -----------------------------------------------------------
# data/raw/ IS committed on purpose: the vendored source file is what makes the
# reported numbers reproducible. data/processed/ is regenerated in ~12 s by
# `python src/run_all.py`, so it is not tracked.
data/processed/

